{
  "about": "Labeled evaluation set for the AI guide's itinerary planner. Catalog: catalog-2026-11-13.json (the app's public Firebase landmarks node, downloaded 2026-11-13). Relevance labels judge the records' own text against the request: 2 = clearly about it, 1 = partly, 0 = not. expectedDistancesKm were computed independently (Python haversine, R = 6371.0088 km, town coordinates from Wikipedia) and are compared with the app's distances to within 0.2 km.",
